1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,800
Welcome everyone.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:07,600
Today I'm joined by Eve from Club Madeira
to talk about their Smart Catalogue.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,800
Eve, thank you for joining us.

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,400
Thank you Leo, it's great to be here.

5
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,800
Let's start with the basics.

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,200
What exactly is the Smart Catalogue?

7
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:24,500
The Smart Catalogue by Club Madeira
is a B2B, invite-only, white-label
AI-powered fundraising engine.

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,800
It's designed specifically for professional partners —
website designers, digital agencies,
consultants, and service providers —

9
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:33,200
who work with clubs and community groups.

10
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:38,400
These partners can embed a fully white-labelled
Smart Catalogue into their clients’ websites.

11
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:43,200
The AI automatically creates and manages
a smart online shop with products
that members are likely to love.

12
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:47,600
When members shop, the club earns commission,
the partner gets recurring revenue,

13
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:51,400
and merchants get targeted exposure —
all with almost no extra work.

14
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:55,000
Who is this platform actually for?

15
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:59,400
It's exclusively for approved professional partners.

16
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:03,200
Clubs don't buy it directly.
Partners control the client relationship,
branding, pricing, and support.

17
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:07,800
There are no monthly platform fees,
no stock to manage,

18
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:11,600
and everything can be handled from a dashboard
or even a smartphone app.

19
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:15,800
How does the AI actually choose
which products to show?

20
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:21,200
The AI uses a practical,
interest-based curation system.

21
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:26,400
Club admins pick their group's main interests
and categories through the smartphone app —

22
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:30,800
things like model flying, scouting,
sports, crafts, parenting, etc.

23
00:01:31,700 --> 00:01:36,200
The AI then pulls products from trusted
merchant feeds and APIs,

24
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:40,400
matches them to those interests,
and scores them for relevance.

25
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:45,200
The catalogue is living — it updates daily,
adding new products and removing ones
that are no longer relevant.

26
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:50,400
During some conversations, your team mentioned
keeping products in a 'Vault'.

27
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:52,800
What is that exactly?

28
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:57,600
The Vault is our internal name
for the central product database.

29
00:01:57,600 --> 00:02:02,200
We don't hold any physical stock —
this is a pure affiliate model.

30
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:06,800
Merchants connect their stores via APIs,
and we pull product data into our system.

31
00:02:07,700 --> 00:02:12,400
It's essentially a large, well-organized database
of normalised product information

32
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:16,200
that our AI can search and curate from efficiently.

33
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:21,000
Your salesman described this Vault
as very rare and special.

34
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:24,200
Is a database really that unusual?

35
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:29,400
Databases themselves are very common —
almost every modern website uses one.

36
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:34,800
What makes our system special is not the database,
but how we combine it with powerful AI

37
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:40,200
to automatically build and maintain highly relevant
catalogues for thousands of different communities

38
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:43,600
with almost no manual effort.

39
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:49,200
That level of smart automation,
especially in the club and community
fundraising space, is quite rare.

40
00:02:50,100 --> 00:02:53,400
So would you say the salesman
was overselling it a bit?

41
00:02:54,300 --> 00:02:57,800
There's always a bit of sales enthusiasm!

42
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:03,200
The core technology — a database plus AI curation —
isn't unique in the broader e-commerce world.

43
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:08,600
But the specific combination we’ve built:
white-label for agencies,
smartphone-first admin,

44
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:13,400
fully automated curation, zero stock,
and strong focus on community fundraising,

45
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:17,200
is genuinely valuable and unusual in this niche.

46
00:03:18,100 --> 00:03:21,400
We prefer to focus on the real benefits
rather than hype.

47
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:25,600
Thank you Eve. This has been very insightful.

48
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:28,800
I'm excited to see how the Smart Catalogue develops.

49
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:32,800
Thank you Leo. It was a pleasure.